# Implementation Plan - Specific Emission Factor Calculator

## Goal Description
Expand the Stationary Combustion calculator to allow users to define fuel properties using Chemical Formula (Atom Counts) in addition to Ultimate Analysis (Mass %).

## User Review Required
> [!NOTE]
> Added a "Basis" selector for Liquid/Solid fuels: "Mass % (Ultimate Analysis)" or "Chemical Formula (Atoms)".
> If "Chemical Formula" is selected, the tool calculates the Carbon Weight % based on atomic weights (C=12.011, H=1.008, etc.) and uses that for the emission factor.

